  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ババス",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%90%E3%83%90%E3%82%B9",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106371839,
      "text": "ババス(Attalea speciosa)は、南アメリカのアマゾン熱帯雨林地方が原産のヤシである。ピアウイ州とマラニョン州のw:Maranhão Babaçu forestsでは、ババスが優占種である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Attalea speciosa",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attalea_speciosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1378644338,
      "text": "Attalea speciosa, the babassu, babassu palm, babaçu, or cusi, is a palm native to the Amazon rainforest region in South America. The babassu palm is the predominant species in the Maranhão Babaçu forests of Maranhão and Piauí states."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Attalea speciosa",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attalea_speciosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171692979,
      "text": "Babasú, palma babasu o cusi Mart. ex Spreng., es una palma de las Arecáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Attalea speciosa",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attalea_speciosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 219189097,
      "text": "Attalea speciosa est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de famille des Arecaceae. Elle est originaire d'Amérique du Sud. Ses fruits, semblables à de petites noix de coco, forment de grosses grappes,et fournissent une huile utilisée pour la production de biocarburants ou en cosmétique."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Babaçu",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baba%C3%A7u",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 72366247,
      "text": "O babaçu, também chamado bauaçu, baguaçu, auaçu, aguaçu, guaguaçu, uauaçu, gebara-uçu, coco-de-macaco, coco-de-palmeira, coco-naiá, coco-pindoba e palha-branca, é uma espécie da família das palmeiras (Arecaceae), dotada de frutos drupáceos com sementes oleaginosas e comestíveis das quais se extrai um óleo, empregado sobretudo na alimentação, remédios, além de ser alvo de pesquisas avançadas para a fabricação de biocombustíveis."
    }
  },
